#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Verification could not be completed. Please try again."
msgstr "Uthibitishaji haukuweza kukamilika. Tafadhali jaribu tena."

#: lib/marshall_web/live/account_live.ex:75
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Verification required. Use an existing passkey, or sign out and request a fresh email link before first enrollment."
msgstr "Uthibitishaji unahitajika. Tumia nenosiri lililopo, au uondoke na uombe kiungo kipya cha barua pepe kabla ya kujiandikisha mara ya kwanza."

#: lib/marshall_web/live/account_live.ex:614
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Verify a passkey before making administrative changes or changing passkeys."
msgstr "Thibitisha nenosiri kabla ya kufanya mabadiliko ya usimamizi au kubadilisha nenosiri."

#: lib/marshall_web/live/account_live.ex:641
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Verify with passkey"
msgstr "Thibitisha kwa kutumia nenosiri"

#: lib/marshall_web/live/account_live.ex:830
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "When enabled, new agent commits include Co-authored-by: Overalls <noreply@overalls.dev>."
msgstr "Ukiwashwa, komiti mpya za wakala hujumuisha Co-authored-by: Overalls <noreply@overalls.dev>."

#: lib/marshall_web/live/account_live.ex:482
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Who you are, how you prove it, and the keys that reach your machines."
msgstr "Wewe ni nani, jinsi unavyothibitisha, na funguo zinazofikia mashine zako."

#: lib/marshall_web/live/account_live.ex:597
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "You sign in with an email link. A passkey proves it is you before administrative changes and before passkey changes; everyday use of your workspace never asks for one."
msgstr "Unaingia kwa kiungo cha barua pepe. Ufunguo wa kuingia huthibitisha utambulisho wako kabla ya mabadiliko ya usimamizi na ya funguo za kuingia; matumizi ya kila siku ya eneo lako la kazi hayauhitaji kamwe."

#: lib/marshall_web/live/account_live.ex:560
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Your email is your sign-in identity and cannot be edited here. Every time on Overalls is shown in your zone; people who share a team, machine or thread with you, and administrators, see your current local time next to your email once a zone is saved."
msgstr "Barua pepe yako ni utambulisho wako wa kuingia na haiwezi kuhaririwa hapa. Saa zote za Overalls huonyeshwa kwa eneo lako; watu wanaoshiriki nawe timu, mashine au mazungumzo, pamoja na wasimamizi, huona saa za sasa za eneo lako kando ya barua pepe yako baada ya eneo kuhifadhiwa."

#: lib/marshall_web/live/account_live.ex:667
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Your passkeys"
msgstr "Funguo zako za kuingia"

#: lib/marshall_web/live/account_live.ex:621
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Your passkeys were reset. Register a replacement before approving administrative changes."
msgstr "Funguo zako za kuingia zimewekwa upya. Sajili mbadala kabla ya kuidhinisha mabadiliko ya usimamizi."

#: lib/marshall_web/live/account_live.ex:525
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Your saved language overrides browser preferences."
msgstr "Lugha yako iliyohifadhiwa hubatilisha mapendeleo ya kivinjari."

#: lib/marshall_web/live/account_live.ex:613
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "[not verified]"
msgstr "[haijathibitishwa]"

#: lib/marshall_web/live/account_live.ex:605
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "[verified]"
msgstr "[imethibitishwa]"

#: lib/marshall_web/live/account_live.ex:492
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "email, time zone and your local clock"
msgstr "barua pepe, saa za eneo na saa yako ya karibu"

#: lib/marshall_web/live/account_live.ex:509
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "new machines and commit attribution"
